* ehr_extract.all_compositions.links ^definition = "Creates a relationship between two Record Components that is orthogonal to the common one of containment. Note that if a recipient is not permitted to see the component linked to, even revealing the link constitutes an inappropriate disclosure. Role is of type CD so that the displayName property of that class can be used in place of any specific coding scheme."
